--- !u!1001 &274221727
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 103749566}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 313948706270051055, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: RUNNER TAKES A TAXI
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2659459170781084179, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'What may be the most shameless shortcut in racing history occurred
        yesterday when a competitor was reportedly seen entering a taxi in the middle
        of an official race.

        The incident took place approximately halfway
        through the course. According to witnesses, the runner suddenly left the
        marked route, approached a waiting automobile, opened the rear door, and
        climbed inside.

        The taxi reportedly traveled several streets before
        stopping near another section of the course. The competitor then emerged
        from the vehicle and continued running as though nothing unusual had happened.

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3198379244358998073, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: -9.01
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3277410486866434425, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: JournaleUI6
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3277410486866434425, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3903668237661538120, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_SizeDelta.x
      value: 12.8231
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3903668237661538120, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.x
      value: -0.0109
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4702836190640835036, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: -18.23
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5402518102195765066, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: CYCLISTS BRAVE THE HILLS
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6059964909105023899, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: -7.41
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6109735740334789137, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Spectators were initially uncertain whether they had witnessed a genuine
        violation or some extraordinary misunderstanding. Their doubts disappeared
        when the runner crossed the finish line several minutes ahead of competitors
        who had followed the complete route.\nOfficials immediately confronted the
        athlete, who allegedly argued that the taxi had merely provided \u201Ctemporary
        assistance.\u201D\nThe explanation did little to satisfy the Racing Committee.
        The competitor was removed from the official results before the end of the
        afternoon.\nThe taxi driver has reportedly been questioned by authorities
        but has refused to comment on the incident. Meanwhile, newspapers across
        the country have already begun calling the event \u201CThe Taxi Race.\u201D"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6109735740334789137, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_margin.w
      value: -0.963562
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7025677484130992791, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: -19.73
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7673294450624766279, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: The local football club secured an impressive victory on Saturday after
        scoring twice during a thrilling second half. Supporters remained in the
        stands long after the final whistle to celebrate their team's latest success.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8021706265186088782, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Pivot.x
      value: 0.5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
