--- !u!1001 &912831407
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 103749566}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 313948706270051055, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: MYSTERIOUS NEW DRUGS
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2659459170781084179, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Authorities have issued a serious warning following reports that a
        new generation of performance-enhancing substances is being secretly sold
        to competitive runners.

        According to investigators, the substances
        are designed specifically to avoid detection during conventional testing.
        Sellers are reportedly promising athletes greater speed, improved endurance,
        and faster recovery while claiming that the substances cannot be identified
        by ordinary examinations.

        The appearance of these products has caused
        considerable concern among racing officials. The new regulator is believed
        to be investigating several suspected suppliers, although authorities have
        so far refused to reveal their identities.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3198379244358998073, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: -10.28
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3277410486866434425, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: JournaleUI3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3277410486866434425, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3561964259888679043, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: -8.09
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3903668237661538120, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.x
      value: -0.0022001266
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5402518102195765066, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: THE VANISHING RECORDS
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6059964909105023899, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: -13.84
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6109735740334789137, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Rumors concerning the drugs have spread rapidly among competitors.
        Some athletes claim that secret sellers are approaching runners before major
        events, offering small bottles and packets at extremely high prices.\nMedical
        experts have warned athletes that the substances may carry unknown risks.
        \u201CAnything sold secretly with promises of extraordinary performance should
        be treated with suspicion,\u201D one specialist stated.\nThe Racing Committee
        has promised to improve its testing methods in response. Officials fear that
        if the new substances prove difficult to detect, the sport could enter an
        entirely new era of cheating."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6109735740334789137, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_margin.w
      value: 1.1889038
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6828725365048007558, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Chaos followed yesterday''s competition when three separate runners
        claimed to have won the same event. Each competitor produced witnesses supporting
        their version of the finish, while officials struggled to determine who had
        actually crossed the line first.

        The result remains temporarily
        suspended. A final decision is expected after the Committee reviews photographs
        and timing records.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6828725365048007558, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_margin.w
      value: 3.4731445
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7011553334276646393, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: -17.73
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7025677484130992791, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: -20.55
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7673294450624766279, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: Officials have announced that the current racing season will continue
        for an additional month following unexpectedly high public interest. Several
        new competitions are expected to be added to the calendar.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8021706265186088782, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Pivot.x
      value: 0.5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
